#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:5
msgid "Folio size"
msgstr "图幅尺寸"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:7
msgid ""
"The working area from the `workspace`_ is defined as a grid of columns and "
"rows. All columns have the same width and all rows have the same height."
msgstr "`工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的工作区域定义为由列和行构成的网格。所有列的宽度相同，所有行的高度相同。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:14
msgid ""
"Figure: QElectroTech folio with 17 columns (0 to 16) and 8 rows (A to H) is "
"shown"
msgstr "图：显示了一个 QElectroTech 图幅，包含 17 列（0 至 16）和 8 行（A 至 H）"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:16
msgid ""
"The parameters that can be customized from **Dimensions of folio** section "
"from the `folio properties PopUp window`_ are:"
msgstr ""
"`图幅属性弹出窗口 <folio properties PopUp window_>`_ 中 **Dimensions of folio** "
"区域可自定义的参数包括："

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:19
msgid "Number of columns."
msgstr "列数。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:20
msgid "Width from columns."
msgstr "列宽。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:21
msgid "Column headers display or hidden."
msgstr "列标题显示或隐藏。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:22
msgid "Number of rows."
msgstr "行数。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:23
msgid "Height from rows."
msgstr "行高。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:24
msgid "Row headers display or hidden."
msgstr "行标题显示或隐藏。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:29
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech dimensions of folios section"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图幅尺寸部分"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_size.rst:31
msgid ""
"The version 0.7 from QElectroTech works with pixels and there is no pre-"
"defined folio sizes. The pixels dimensions according `ISO 216`_ are:"
